      "notes": "On the tank as soon as one hit has landed on him: your staple, and in a raid the heal you cast most. From 25, Oath of Light adds the same flat amount to every rank close to your level that you cast on the tank. Rank 1 does the job to 42 (a Dwarf to 43), rank 2 from 43, rank 3 from 50 and rank 4 from 54; at 60 without raid buffs, rank 4 does the same job as rank 5 for less mana."
    },
