            "type": "Player",
            "index": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": "On everyone else once a hit or two has landed, yourself included. Without the Oath bonus a small rank is the best balance of heal size and mana: rank 1 to 41 (a Human moves to rank 2 at 42, a Dwarf at 43, an Undead at 44), rank 2 to 49, rank 4 from 50, and rank 5 at 60 in a raid, where your buffs pay for the bigger heal."
